# Agent instructions

**Read `README.md` first** — it is the source of truth for why this Cursor fork exists, its goals, and what has shipped here.
**Read `AGENTS.md`** for architecture, consistency rules, code patterns, and testing.
If docs and code disagree, trust code and update docs in the same change.
If anything is unclear or instructions conflict, STOP and ask.

## Code and verification

After you finish, run `npm run build`, `npm run skills:check`, and `npm test` when relevant.
Write simple, minimal code.
Prefer existing patterns.
Do not add unrequested features or APIs.

## Upstream merges

This is a fork. Keep changes minimal and localized so later pulls from upstream stay manageable — avoid drive-by refactors, formatting churn, and unrelated file touch-ups.
